## Error Handling
| Error | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
{% if category in ('ai-ml',) %}
| Invalid API Key | Key is missing, expired, or has extra whitespace | Verify key in {{ display_name }} dashboard. Check for trailing newlines |
| Rate Limited | Exceeded requests/tokens per minute | Check usage at {{ docs_url | default('docs.' + company + '.com') }}/usage |
{% elif category in ('data-platform',) %}
| Connection Refused | Wrong host/port or firewall blocking | Check connection string, verify network access |
| Authentication Failed | Wrong password or expired credentials | Reset credentials in {{ display_name }} dashboard |
{% elif category in ('design-creative',) %}
| Token Expired | OAuth access token past lifetime | Refresh token or generate new personal access token |
| Insufficient Scope | Token missing required permissions | Re-authorize with correct OAuth scopes |
{% else %}
| Invalid API Key | Incorrect or expired key | Verify key in {{ display_name }} dashboard |
| Rate Limited | Exceeded quota | Check quota at {{ docs_url | default('docs.' + company + '.com') }} |
{% endif %}
| Network Error | Firewall blocking | Ensure outbound HTTPS allowed |
| Module Not Found | Installation failed | Run `npm install` or `pip install` again |

## Examples

### TypeScript Setup
```typescript
import { {{ client_class | default(display_name + 'Client') }} } from '{{ npm_package | default(company + '-sdk') }}';

const client = new {{ client_class | default(display_name + 'Client') }}({
{% if category in ('data-platform',) %}
  connectionString: process.env.{{ company | upper }}_DATABASE_URL,
{% elif category in ('design-creative',) %}
  accessToken: process.env.{{ company | upper }}_ACCESS_TOKEN,
{% else %}
  apiKey: process.env.{{ company | upper }}_API_KEY,
{% endif %}
});
```

### Python Setup
```python
from {{ pip_package | default(company) }} import {{ client_class | default(display_name + 'Client') }}

client = {{ client_class | default(display_name + 'Client') }}(
{% if category in ('data-platform',) %}
    connection_string=os.environ.get('{{ company | upper }}_DATABASE_URL')
{% elif category in ('design-creative',) %}
    access_token=os.environ.get('{{ company | upper }}_ACCESS_TOKEN')
{% else %}
    api_key=os.environ.get('{{ company | upper }}_API_KEY')
{% endif %}
)
```

